           115 turns, 0.2 mm x 12 mm tape, 49/73 mm radii, rho_c = 399 uOhm.cm^2
The straight-leg length is NOT published; it is the single free parameter.

bracket: field constant spans 0.768 - 1.188 mT/A over L = 300 - 0 mm
         self-inductance spans 2.308 - 12.245 mH over the same range

--- Fit A: straight length chosen to match the FIELD CONSTANT ---
  straight half-length L   =  112.59 mm   (turn length 0.8336 m)
  field constant           =   0.810 mT/A   published 0.81   error   -0.0%
  self-inductance          =   5.855 mH     published 3.05   error  +92.0%
  discharge tau            =  12.964 s      published 13.53  (MEASURED)  error   -4.2%
  series contact R         =   0.454 mOhm  -> naive L/R = 12.90 s

--- Fit B: straight length chosen to match the SELF-INDUCTANCE ---
  straight half-length L   =   22.66 mm   (turn length 0.4739 m)
